{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_title", "source_sha256": "a0248fa6981d3aac6dc06aeeaaee231ae512d2f46e9f6622f800af0bc3f3726c", "ja": "何回でも、何度でも", "zh": "无论几次、无论几遍", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e41308e36a0bf22b77a001c6fc4a086370f8d4ea55d08f7377e8c5cc67d137e2", "ja": "日々、善行に励む天空騎士団。そんな彼らに\nご褒美をあげようと、朋花は自らセンターに\n立つ事を決める。仲間達と楽しくレッスンに\n励むが、公演に来られない子豚ちゃんからの\n手紙を受け取り、朋花は胸を痛める。", "zh": "天空骑士团日日辛勤行善，为了奖励他们，\n朋花决定主动接下Center的位置。\n她与同伴们快乐地参与训练课程，\n却收到了无法亲临公演的小猪所写的信，\n这令朋花心痛不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e89fb09755d7eda2f3837de3d2e2cd60f3ff8766efec79a84c45f042e19a84d8", "ja": "（朋花の思いを詰め込んだステージが終わった！\nまだ、拍手が鳴り止まない……）", "zh": "（充满朋花心意的表演结束了！\n会场中的掌声依然不绝于耳……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "d22f3456e3d3d5172a9bafd41360b3df7d94ecc4e299025087775b6716539bf3", "ja": "今の曲は、私のワガママで……\nひとりきりで、歌わせていただきました。", "zh": "刚刚这首歌，是大家包容了我的任性……\n让我独自一人演唱完的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "e040faac6c4d4bad7ab1e31651b108c195dad87066ce9fef64955fa06c1111d0", "ja": "ひとりで、がんばっている子豚ちゃんがいる……。\nならば私も、ひとりでがんばろうと思ったのです～。", "zh": "因为有只小猪，正在独自努力……\n所以我就想，我也要一个人努力看看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1003_p", "source_sha256": "40e0cc2de964fb50254c21c00b2263b79b5b3ae950f52f089a255d9399428306", "ja": "（ステージの上でファンの人達と向き合い、朋花は\nひとりひとりと話をするように、語りかけている）", "zh": "（朋花站在舞台上面对粉丝们，\n她仿佛个别对着每一位粉丝说话。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b45c307169bbd6791381de92d9f67ece2bbd99cbe6e23849f17c8511f41e9b7", "ja": "けどやっぱり、私はひとりではありませんでした。\n私には、私を支えてくれた大切な仲間たちや……。", "zh": "不过，我果然不是独自一人。\n我拥有支持我的重要伙伴们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "3e7e8c99033af5048eb11c3b3d362b721b16dbf1e966d4187bd893b9f0c04b7b", "ja": "何より、こうして私を応援してくれる、\n大勢の子豚ちゃん達がいるのですから。", "zh": "最重要的，是有着像现在这样\n声援我的众多小猪们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "abb7d14875be96397951661a0479ae2e3e50a263161947afbea529fb50087b91", "ja": "今日は本当に、ありがとうございました。\nまた、この場所で会いましょう～。", "zh": "今天真的很谢谢大家。\n下次，再让我们在这里重逢吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "83fcb9b6529872bb9b6dda8914e325982422e87c11f7864324817bbcca600ffd", "ja": "ワァァァァ……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1008_p", "source_sha256": "863db0c04cc34df53a2a158241503c2836938520bc3e3013f277b027fbe82bf2", "ja": "朋花、お疲れさま！\nいいステージになったな。", "zh": "朋花，辛苦你了！\n这场表演很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "a543295b20605df0d948563ef707505755252c8df592d43c50052982edb63eb6", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。\n聖母の光を、届けることができていたでしょうか～？", "zh": "谢谢你～\n圣母的光芒，是否有照耀到大家身上了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ae041404ff3c423a59d528306c6d2685170ec2ad5a755306d5e7c569dffdf328", "ja": "ああ、届いていたと思う。朋花も、\nお客さんの顔を見て、わかったんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯，我想是照耀到了。\n你从观众的表情，应该也看得出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "cc8e241aa9386f90d4a0b80213bafa2717b865c116e9bfec6b4cfeedbdabfea9", "ja": "そうですね～。けど私は、\nこれで充分だとは思っていませんよ～？", "zh": "说得也是～\n不过，我可不认为这样就足够了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "ed9bd93ea16253e10a529945929cc95e9f8e53334df4d4fd291365d5d853d113", "ja": "劇場に子豚ちゃん達、全員は入れませんから。\nこれからも、何回も、公演をしなくてはなりません～。", "zh": "毕竟剧场没办法容纳所有的小猪。\n今后我必须不断地举办公演～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "cf5c810b6b8ee1543f97382f80a7c0bca378dabd1ea5a7ca97807378b2559131", "ja": "私は世界中の子豚ちゃん達に、\n声を届けなければならないんですからね～♪", "zh": "因为我得把声音传达给\n全世界的小猪们嘛～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1b210bbbbdb284da1a823ba1bba75b7bf0c3006def848a46f8f41d0d09fde1d7", "ja": "世界か……うん、大きく出たな！", "zh": "全世界吗……嗯，很远大的抱负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "ecfbbb523d5c54e8c28fb85087923d52203bf28917d2e7c5570d1c9069bf934c", "ja": "ええ。{$P$}さん。\nそのために、身を粉にする覚悟はありますか～？", "zh": "是啊，{$P$}先生。\n你有为此粉身碎骨的决心吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1016_p", "source_sha256": "67325f12d0c8dcf06d8c10c24c085c9869e0c14d895b1cb8d955797919271a85", "ja": "もちろん！\n朋花の声を、世界中に届けよう！", "zh": "那是当然！\n我们一起让你的声音，传遍全世界吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "5e77445205d5f9443be25c9249ee0170a9effa9d03c1651f568f309b0e291147", "ja": "うふふ。{$P$}さんの答え、\nたしかに聞きました。", "zh": "呵呵，我确实收到\n{$P$}先生的回答了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "72efa35fc393f184187e04bb550243d2771d9373402d8a209f617456a4221ef1", "ja": "私のために、身を粉にして働いてくださいね～？\n約束ですよ～？", "zh": "请你为我呕心沥血地工作喔～\n我们一言为定啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "fb7778bb4f0ec2d4031447b2ab5866e6cf255ce4fa2276acc26881dea92a938e", "ja": "朋花ちゃん朋花ちゃん！　すごかったよ！\nさすがの茜ちゃんも、あのステージには圧倒された！", "zh": "小朋花、小朋花！你好厉害！\n连小茜我都被你的表演震撼到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "79c9a355b23d035815f415de06074547edb04b30bc7875045e771f28806aa263", "ja": "最後、ひとりでステージに立ちたいと聞いた時は、\n驚きましたが……感動しました……！", "zh": "听到你说最后想一个人站上舞台时，我确实很讶异……\n但你的表演让我好感动……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "aee1879645bd3aa939d8de2759ac720b7f2203ce28fabe25d48e9f5e17d9cec3", "ja": "ありさの心のカメラも、\nあやうくメモリーが足りなくなるところでした！", "zh": "亚利沙心中的相机，\n也差点就要容量不足了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "f0829f1df5e392755f5991341cfefc5651687a4a93e222e840470646066c2f4f", "ja": "いわば神ステージ……！\nいえ、最高の聖母ステージでした！！", "zh": "要说的话，就是超神的表演……！\n不，是最精彩的圣母表演！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "1036b9c3b80857d56ca614bf5264c7183fcc16dc16eb1b4189a86f92c057da45", "ja": "みなさんのご協力に感謝しますよ～。おかげで\n子豚ちゃん達に、思いを届けることができました～。", "zh": "真的很感谢大家的帮忙～托各位的福，\n我成功把自己的心意传达给小猪们了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf38455a353a4212821bf36e784fc0eb4a2167c7f3e38873d17ea672f2caa49b", "ja": "ホント、朋花めちゃくちゃカッコよかったよ！\nアタシも、またセンターに立ちたい！って思った！", "zh": "朋花刚刚真的超级帅气的！\n让我又开始想当Center了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cc2dde7e7944c78b30ea6d9a57692c0597666da6e65908e1f8426d33fb626fce", "ja": "でも今は、緊張が抜けたせいかお腹が空いたな～。\n{$P$}、みんな、打ち上げいこうよ！", "zh": "不过大概是因为心情放松下来了，现在肚子好饿～\n{$P$}还有大家，我们去开庆功宴吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "879fc53a71d3f733d50bdfcd62ae0834a0e26d3de3790c2dca2b2c5b966ed547", "ja": "あはっ、いいねいいね！\n茜ちゃんは全面的に賛成だーい♪", "zh": "啊哈，不错不错！\n小茜全面赞成──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "b4dbc25400c43ec575992acc95f46380048f13d05fd0a98753b459c1acfabdfd", "ja": "そうですね、どこに行きましょうか。\n紬さん、何か食べたいものはありますか～？", "zh": "也对，我们要去哪里呢？\n䌷，你有什么想吃的东西吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3d5f29f5d07a4cd7f8405ac37e91b78e85958b22dab54f1dec3258a36f9d862a", "ja": "そ、そうですね。\n私は、あんみつとか……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛。\n我想吃馅蜜之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c7b205c1e3651b25835d154a68f7b08d507bc94c8823c6c363fab7a62f789b4", "ja": "じゃあ、ファミレスに行きましょうっ。\n茜ちゃんの大好きなプリンもありますよ♪", "zh": "那么，我们就去家庭餐厅吧。\n那里也有小茜最喜欢的布丁喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "1b6136488b431491240060d4a3415854f7f0955024dac870020e926a1bce9969", "ja": "うふふ、それでは決まりですね～♪\nみなさん、行きましょう～。", "zh": "呵呵，那就这么决定了～♪\n各位，我们出发吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1031_p", "source_sha256": "22f5c48d1a1751621072af4d5aaf52966ffa0679d49426f26d32bc23672b5971", "ja": "（朋花は落ち着いた雰囲気があるけど、こうして\nみんなと笑っていると、年相応の女の子って感じだな）", "zh": "（朋花虽然稳重，但像这样看着她跟大家一起欢笑\n的模样，就觉得她依然是个天真烂漫的女孩呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_035_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_035_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "f68025d16bc767d3d8200aca37550c39a1cddbff3f4d9f6f407b8b23d58785c8", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん。\n打ち上げに向かう前に、ちょっといいですか～？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生。\n去庆功宴之前，可以打扰你一下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
